","clubhouse","shopping"],"description":"Great 3-bedroom, 2-bathroom townhome, ready for move-in, in the desired Island Club West community. This is a townhome unit with Bedrooms on the 2nd floor and living areas on the first level. The kitchen comes fully stocked with a refrigerator, range, and microwave. The laundry is in a closet in the kitchen area and includes a washer and dryer. Inside the first level are ample spaces for a dining room and a family, but there's still open space for so much more. The sliding doors take you to the outdoor area where you can enjoy views of the pond. The community is gated and has a clubhouse with amenities such as a basketball court, sand volleyball, fitness center, Steam room, pool, spa, picnic areas, Tennis court, and even a pool for the little ones. Located just minutes from shops, doctor offices, restaurants, banks, and so much more. The rental amount includes some of the utilities, so what are you waiting for? Come see this property before it is gone!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":1700,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m732435623r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","porch","yard","back_side","incomplete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m732435623s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m732435623r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m3811153381r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["other_interiors","unknown"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m3811153381s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c02742779f2fcc1174762aa9l-m3811153381r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/f4534bd8c0274277